Clothos first quest has 2 ways of solving it. One has one +20 reward, the other has one +10 and two +5.

Starting Recipes:
* Berry juice (Cooking table)
* Fuel from sticks (Oven)
* Fuel from firewood (Oven)
* Fuel from coal (Oven)

Requirements/Chain of events:
* Gerry 20 for Talking to Astrologer
* Opening the church:
  * Donkey demands carrots for bodies
  * Gerry tells you about Gunter
* Infinite Blue Points available when Stone + Stone Cutter
* Keepers Journal needs 5 Faith at Snake
* Stone and Sand (Build Cost) for entrances between plains and stone garden
* Better Save Soul Repair Order: Soul extractor, Soul healer, Soul portal


* Smiler
    * "Find out more about him", "Bring him a berry pie to make him talkative"
    * Learn_remote_control -> "Learn more about technology" -> "Ask Euric about the insert in the Book" -> "Ask Smiler about Human Healing" -> Human Soul Handling Blueprint
* Gerry
    * Ask about lost tooth